  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Referendum in South Sudan 2010-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sudan folkomrr&#xf6;stning i s&#xf6;dra Sudan 2010-11</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till omr&#xf6;stning om sj&#xe4;lvst&#xe4;ndighet f&#xf6;r S&#xf6;dra Sudan. Insatsen avslutades i april 2013 utan att finansiell rapportering var f&#xe4;rdig, c:a 1 615 000 SEK av det svenska st&#xf6;det var oanv&#xe4;nt och &#xe5;terbetalades av UNDP  2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the referendum on independence for southern Sudan in 2011. Implemented by UNDP . The contribution was closed in 2013 without proper financial closure by UNDP and Sida. UNDP refunded 1 615 000 SEK to Sida in 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
